### Переменная
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Корень
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Все путевые листы
GET {{host}}/trips

### 3. Фильтр по статусу
GET {{host}}/trips?status=completed

### 4. Фильтр по водителю
GET {{host}}/trips?driverName=Иванов

### 5. Один по ID
GET {{host}}/trips/1

### 6. Несуществующий ID (ожидаем 404)
GET {{host}}/trips/999

### 7. Создать (ожидаем 201)
POST {{host}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverName": "Сидоров С.С.",
  "vehicleNumber": "С789МН99",
  "route": "Москва — Рязань",
  "departureTime": "2025-01-17T09:00:00",
  "workHours": 0,
  "fuelConsumed": 0,
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 8. Некорректные данные (ожидаем 400)
POST {{host}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverName": "",
  "vehicleNumber": "X000XX00",
  "workHours": -5
}

### 9. PUT — полное обновление (200)
PUT {{host}}/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverName": "Иванов И.И.",
  "vehicleNumber": "А123ВС77",
  "route": "Москва — Тула — Москва",
  "departureTime": "2025-01-15T08:00:00",
  "returnTime": "2025-01-15T20:00:00",
  "workHours": 12,
  "fuelConsumed": 52.0,
  "status": "completed"
}

### 10. PATCH — частичное обновление (200)
PATCH {{host}}/trips/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnTime": "2025-01-16T19:00:00",
  "workHours": 11.5,
  "fuelConsumed": 48.7,
  "status": "completed"
}

### 11. DELETE (200)
DELETE {{host}}/trips/2

### 12. Повторный DELETE (ожидаем 404)
DELETE {{host}}/trips/2